{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>רבת</b> — The tav in place of heh, like <b>ושבת</b>. It is a modifier whose modified noun is missing, like a measure of time and its like. This is a hint to the length of the exile."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 120, :notes {0 "Resolved the reading 'מלה תואר' (a modifier word) as modifying noun missing; alternatively could be 'מלת תואר' (a word of modification), grammatical terminology."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:06.665746966Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}